2026-07-10 17:41:07,991 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: Based on our company context, we can identify some potential security risks related to GDPR compliance, such as the risk of non-compliance with data residency and transfer requirements. However, our standard data residency policy is EU-only, which aligns with the requirement. We also have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside the EU unless there is an explicit legal basis.

